        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-24T00:21:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's a new 'source' of damage each time so you buff (and possibly reduce) each instance of damage, if you had Tempest's <em>Gene-Bound Shackles</em> in play that could be 3 damage per card discarded!</p>",
