        "created_at": "2013-09-24T01:46:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>if you had Tempest's <em>Gene-Bound Shackles</em> in play that could be 3 damage per card discarded!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That is in fact exactly how I beat Warlord Voss in my second-ever game.&nbsp; Shackles + Nemesis rule + no minions in play = 12 damage turn.</p>",
